learnings:
  - Lengthening an unlock's lifetime shifts risk to 'who else can join it'; make joins visible (a log row plus a notify) rather than silent.
  - Builders add adjacent items beyond a ruling (reconsider:extend); reviews must check scope against the ruling text.
